Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,760] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 我从来不相信怀裁规
Segment #2   [00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:03,840] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 我14岁就出来工作了
Segment #3   [00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,660] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 没钱 没学历 没人看得起
Segment #4   [00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:09,420] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 12 | Text: 我扫过街 捡过垃圾 做过小贩
Segment #5   [00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,800] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 在工厂都和店都包装
Segment #6   [00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,440] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 4  | Text: 厨房清洁
Segment #7   [00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,040] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 5  | Text: 不管有多失忆
Segment #8   [00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:18,200] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 15 | Text: 我都不会用烂泥这两个字来形容我自己
Segment #9   [00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,540] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 3  | Text: 我非常相信
Segment #10  [00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,100] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 做事要不就不做
Segment #11  [00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,500] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 要做就要做到最好
Segment #12  [00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,780] | Elapsed:  11.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 这样才能出人头地
